 fate of not only the earth, but Heaven and Hell lie in your hands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEinlanzer pays homages to some of the fun, familiar themes of past games while breaking many of the tropes of the genre.  Einlanzer is a massive experience that any lover of fantasy, engrossing storytelling, or strategic battles will love!","developers":["Andrew Ryan Henke"],"dlc":[573190],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553760/header.jpg?t=1727114725","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Nostalgia Addict Games LLC ALL RIGHTS RESERVED","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/553760/85531/a4d72cee7d65d4e47bafd24dafea2f9229c8cc6b/1751301094/dash_av1.mpd?t=1483653875","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/553760/85531/a4d72cee7d65d4e47bafd24dafea2f9229c8cc6b/1751301094/dash_h264.mpd?t=1483653875","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/553760/85531/a4d72cee7d65d4e47bafd24dafea2f9229c8cc6b/1751301094/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1483653875","id":256677400,"name":"Einlanzer Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256677400/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1483653875"}],"name":"Einlanzer","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Einlanzer - $2.99 USD","packageid":145596,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy Einlanzer"}],"packages":[145596],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae XP / Vista / 7 / 8 / 8.1 / 10 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong